{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56293","headline":"五言同乔父君游茅溪兰若一[首] · 王渐","name":"五言同乔父君游茅溪兰若一[首]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松柏江头寺，寅缘胜虎谿。\n水云晴过慢，沙鹭[湿]（温）飞低。\n兰若曾岩抱，旃檀画阁齐。\n褰帷双树北，行道一灯留（疑当作「西」字。\n）落日催轩骑，秋城限鼓鼙。\n临川兴不尽，真赏寄丹梯。\n（均见日本藏唐抄本《唐诗卷》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王渐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}